# Trivy vulnerability suppressions
# Each entry must document WHY it's suppressed and the remediation path.

# --- ARLogAnalyzer.jar (pre-built Java artifact) ---
# Fix: rebuild JAR with updated org.json ≥ 20230227 and snappy-java ≥ 1.1.10.4.
# Tracked for remediation in a separate ticket before the next production release.

# org.json stack overflow (json-java ≤ 20221018)
CVE-2022-45688
# org.json parser OOM (json-java ≤ 20230227)
CVE-2023-5072
# snappy-java unchecked chunk length → DoS
CVE-2023-34455
# snappy-java chunk length overflow → DoS
CVE-2023-43642

# --- Go stdlib CVEs requiring Go 1.25+ ---
# Fix available in Go 1.25.x / 1.26.x — not yet stable-released.
# Suppressed until Go 1.25 is available in the CI runner and go.mod is updated.

# net/url: incorrect IPv6 host literal parsing (fixed in 1.25.8, 1.26.1)
CVE-2026-25679
# crypto/x509: unbounded chain-building work (fixed in 1.25.9, 1.26.2)
CVE-2026-32280
# internal/syscall/unix: Root.Chmod symlink follow (no upstream fix yet)
CVE-2026-32282
